--replace .textidote.replacements
--remove otherlanguage,listing,minted,lstlisting,verbatim,tikzpicture,mplibcode,sequencediagram,markdown,plantuml,mermaid,algorithm,algorithmic,equation,equation*,align,align*,tabular,tabularx,longtable,tblr
--remove-macros pagestyle,thispagestyle,pagenumbering,renewcommand,newcommand,setcounter,addtocounter,label,includegraphics,printbibliography,printglossaries,printglossary,printunsrtglossary,printacronyms,tableofcontents,listoffigures,listoftables,listoflistings,lstlistoflistings,raggedbottom,microtypesetup,Titelblatt,bibliographystyle,IEEEpubid,IEEEpeerreviewmaketitle,IEEEoverridecommandlockouts,IEEEauthorblockA,IEEEauthorblockN,AtEndDocument,lipsum,noindent,hfil,bibliography,email,sffamily,Versicherung,addcontentsline,firstexaminer,secondexaminer,thirdexaminer,dateofexamination,placeofbirth,faculty,department,microtypecontext,begingroup,endgroup,qed,sidecomment,frontmatter,mainmatter,backmatter,appendix
